<li><a href="#checklist-item-3%3A-bootnode%2C-sybil%2C-and-peer-verification-controls">Checklist item 3: Bootnode, sybil, and peer verification controls</a></li>
<li><a href="#checklist-item-4%3A-zero-trust-and-microsegmentation-for-agentic-environments">Checklist item 4: Zero trust and microsegmentation for agentic environments</a></li>
<li><a href="#our-perspective%3A-security-architecture-is-a-product-decision%2C-not-just-an-ops-task">Our perspective: Security architecture is a product decision, not just an ops task</a></li>
