</ul>
<h2 id="key-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Key Takeaways</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Point</th>
<th>Details</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Prioritize threat modeling</td>
<td>Understanding threats and managing cryptographic keys safely is the first line of defense for P2P AI systems.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Encrypt every connection</td>
